{"id":140429840,"slug":"people-i-mostly-admire","title":"People I Mostly Admire...","subtitle":"A weekend round up!","post_date":"2024-01-06T21:31:09.954Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/people-i-mostly-admire","wordcount":161,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:55:08.572Z","body_sha256":"f6862d99beef70860d451b5abd3c890ca901bc8e9686e2bf84fd700c6fbfda42","text_words":157,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists are on a plane to SF.   Thus, i’ll take the opportunity to recommend the following items to my audience from people I know and like.</p><p>Podcast: <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-tim-ferriss-show/id863897795?i=1000640642670\">Nolan Williams, M.D. appears on Tim Ferris talking SAINT and Psychedelic Medicine </a></p><p>Essay: <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/psychfox/p/the-age-of-the-divided-self?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;utm_campaign=post\">The Age of the Divided Self</a> by regular guest and frontier psychiatrists contributor <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;@Psych Fox&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:15519985,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/59d1c6de-6415-4efe-8930-dee3aacb686a_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;28267daf-a607-41eb-b43c-5c9014f99358&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> </p><p>Essay: <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/bessstillman/p/remembering-things-that-havent-happened?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_medium=ios&amp;utm_campaign=post\">Remember Things That Haven’t Happened Yet</a> is a remarkable essay by <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Bess Stillman&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:71534540,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/48f726a3-06a6-42bb-9e07-ee6d5b1109ca_960x960.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;283514ab-ee40-4b3e-b731-ed2cee359bdc&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> who is a dear friend and brilliant writer.   Her husband is dying.  But aren’t we all?   Not like this.  </p><p>Scientific Paper: <a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-023-02705-w\">Magnesium-Ibogaine therapy in Veterans With Traumatic Brain Injury</a> by Cherian, et. Al. In which most patients remit from PTSD, Anxiety and Depression with single dose treatment. </p><p>Substack: <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Lila&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:37262322,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3e42498b-2a65-4cc0-a072-8608831166d9_2240x3360.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c494cbfb-1b14-4ee7-a568-57f6bcadea4b&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> is now here on Substack   She is the queen of intimacy writing and podcasting.  Subscribe.  You won't be sad    We had dinner last night!</p><p>And Quinn got to fly with daddy on the subway!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9N9B!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfca4228-5099-4e25-8a57-433cc9fc614b_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9N9B!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfca4228-5099-4e25-8a57-433cc9fc614b_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9N9B!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.co